        <h2>The Problem</h2>
        <p>Many travelers to Zanzibar face: safe beaches, kid activities, family-friendly accommodations. With 2,900 monthly searches for "zanzibar malaria" and competing narratives online, parents need clear, evidence-based guidance from a licensed Zanzibar tour operator — specifically focused on children's safety and entertainment.</p>
